  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "description": "Guia de leitura para investigacao por endpoint.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "### Como investigar um endpoint\n- Selecione uma `Route` e, se quiser, reduza por `Method`.\n- Veja primeiro **4xx**, **5xx** e **P95**. Eles respondem se o problema e contrato, falha ou lentidao.\n- Use os graficos por status e latencia para entender se o problema e constante ou em picos.\n- Feche a analise com logs do endpoint e traces do caso de uso associado.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Como Ler O Drilldown",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "description": "Volume por segundo do endpoint filtrado. Serve para saber se a lentidao aparece sob carga alta ou baixa.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 2,
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(designsoftddd_http_server_requests_total{http_route=~\"$route\",http_method=~\"$method\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Selected Request Rate",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "description": "Percentual 4xx do endpoint filtrado. Alto aqui normalmente significa validacao, autenticacao ou contrato sendo violado.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 2,
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "100 * (sum(rate(designsoftddd_http_server_requests_total{http_route=~\"$route\",http_method=~\"$method\",http_status_class=\"4xx\"}[$__rate_interval])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(designsoftddd_http_server_requests_total{http_route=~\"$route\",http_method=~\"$method\"}[$__rate_interval])), 0.000001))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "4xx Ratio",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "description": "Percentual 5xx do endpoint filtrado. Se subir, abra logs e traces imediatamente.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 2,
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "100 * (sum(rate(designsoftddd_http_server_requests_total{http_route=~\"$route\",http_method=~\"$method\",http_status_class=\"5xx\"}[$__rate_interval])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(designsoftddd_http_server_requests_total{http_route=~\"$route\",http_method=~\"$method\"}[$__rate_interval])), 0.000001))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "5xx Ratio",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "description": "P95 do endpoint filtrado. Se este valor subir com 5xx zerado, o problema costuma ser performance e nao indisponibilidade.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 3,
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(designsoftddd_http_server_duration_seconds_bucket{http_route=~\"$route\",http_method=~\"$method\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Endpoint P95 Latency",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "description": "Mostra se o endpoint esta respondendo majoritariamente com sucesso, erro de cliente ou erro de servidor.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "id": 6,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (http_status_class) (rate(designsoftddd_http_server_requests_total{http_route=~\"$route\",http_method=~\"$method\",http_status_class=~\"$status_class\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{http_status_class}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Requests by Status Class",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "description": "Compare p50, p95 e p99 do endpoint. Distancia grande entre eles indica poucos requests muito mais lentos que o normal.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10
      },
      "id": 7,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(designsoftddd_http_server_duration_seconds_bucket{http_route=~\"$route\",http_method=~\"$method\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(designsoftddd_http_server_duration_seconds_bucket{http_route=~\"$route\",http_method=~\"$method\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(designsoftddd_http_server_duration_seconds_bucket{http_route=~\"$route\",http_method=~\"$method\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Latency Distribution for Selected Endpoint",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "description": "Detalha o status final do endpoint. Bom para separar, por exemplo, um 404 esperado de um 500 inesperado.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "id": 8,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (http_status_code) (rate(designsoftddd_http_server_requests_total{http_route=~\"$route\",http_method=~\"$method\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{http_status_code}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Requests by Status Code",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "description": "Mostra quais casos de uso estao sendo executados pelo endpoint filtrado. Ajuda a mapear a regra de negocio afetada.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 18
      },
      "id": 9,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (app_use_case, app_outcome) (rate(designsoftddd_use_case_executions_total{http_route=~\"$route\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{app_use_case}} • {{app_outcome}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Use Cases Behind This Endpoint",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "description": "Logs estruturados do endpoint filtrado. Procure por `app_outcome=error` e use o `trace_id` para abrir o fluxo no Tempo.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26
      },
      "id": 10,
      "options": {
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": true,
        "showLabels": true,
        "showTime": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "wrapLogMessage": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "{service_name=\"rocketseat-ddd-api\"} |= \"Use case\" |~ \"$route\"",
          "queryType": "range",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Endpoint Logs",
      "type": "logs"
    },
    {
      "description": "Atalho mental para navegar do endpoint para o trace correspondente.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 26
      },
      "id": 11,
      "options": {
        "content": "### Como fechar a investigacao\n- Se **5xx Ratio** subir, abra primeiro os logs do endpoint.\n- Copie um `trace_id` e abra o Explore do Tempo.\n- Quando houver um unico caso de uso dominante, filtre por `name = \"$use_case\"` no Tempo.\n- Compare o tempo do span filho do caso de uso com o tempo total HTTP para descobrir se a lentidao esta dentro ou fora da regra de negocio.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Trace Drilldown",
      "type": "text"
    }
  ],
